   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The passive in describing processes",
     "texto": [
      "The passive **być + participle** lets attention focus on what receives the action: **książki są skanowane** («the books are scanned»). The participle agrees with the subject in gender and number.",
      "The agent can appear with **przez**: **opisy są uzupełniane przez bibliotekarza** («the descriptions are completed by the librarian»). Do not confuse the passive with the impersonal construction with **-się**, such as **przekazuje się** («it is handed over / they are handed over»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
